  "d2_state": "A backs its private FULL while a1 and a2 start together. B spawns later and takes A's backed capacity for b1 and b2. b3 uses a1's pages after tool-aware write-back. b3 retires to make room for demand H2D to a1. a2 retires before a1's final EOS triggers A's pre-JOIN H2D. b1 and b2 continue throughout A's recovery.",
